# Compendio D&D 5e (5etools)
#
# Producción (Vercel) y desarrollo por defecto: omitir esta variable.
# Los datos se cargan en runtime desde el mirror de 5etools en GitHub.
#
# Solo para desarrollo offline: descomentar y copiar JSON desde backup-jsons/
# a public/5etools/ (ver README).
#
# VITE_5ETOOLS_DATA=local

# Upstream update feeds (GitHub) — advanced / optional.
#
# GitHub is only an update feed; at runtime the app's own IndexedDB is the
# source of truth. These overrides let you repoint the feeds WITHOUT code
# changes — useful when a 5etools mirror rotates (e.g. `-3` → `-4`) or to use
# a fork. Set the var and redeploy. Omit them to use the built-in defaults.
#
# 5etools compendium mirror (default: 5etools-mirror-3/5etools-src @ main):
# VITE_5ETOOLS_MIRROR=5etools-mirror-3/5etools-src
# VITE_5ETOOLS_REF=main
#
# Amellwind homebrew feed (default: TheGiddyLimit/homebrew @ master):
# VITE_HOMEBREW_MIRROR=TheGiddyLimit/homebrew
# VITE_HOMEBREW_REF=master
#
# Unearthed Arcana / prerelease feed (default: TheGiddyLimit/unearthed-arcana @ master):
# VITE_UA_MIRROR=TheGiddyLimit/unearthed-arcana
# VITE_UA_REF=master
